    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in the heart of Crossmolina, this mid-terrace two-storey townhouse presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a family home or investment property with potential. While the property would benefit from some modernisation, it offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming living room, dining room and kitchen, while the first floor features four bedrooms and a family bathroom. The generous layout provides ample space for family living and offers purchasers the chance to create a home tailored to their own tastes and requirements.\n\nA particular feature of the property is its large rear garden, which benefits from convenient rear access and offers excellent potential for outdoor enjoyment, gardening or further enhancement.\n\nCrossmolina is a picturesque and thriving town located along the banks of the River Deel, renowned for its strong community spirit and attractive natural surroundings. The town is approximately 10km from Ballina, providing easy access to a wide range of retail, employment and transport services. The area is also celebrated for its proximity to Lough Conn, one of Ireland's premier trout fishing destinations, together with the stunning landscapes of North Mayo and the Wild Atlantic Way.\n\nThis property offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious home in a sought-after location with plenty of scope to add value and create a comfortable residence."
      },
